          "image_source": "images/page_4_image_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.402,
            0.83,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": "As the length of the central line is not specified, we can take it to be of any length."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.449,
            0.83,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": "Let us take AB to be the central line such that the length of AB is 8 cm. We write this as $\\mathrm { A B } = 8$ cm."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.496,
            0.633,
            0.517
          ],
          "content": "Here, the first wave is drawn as a half circle."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.263,
            0.524,
            0.678,
            0.634
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
